# Phase 0 — Final state

## Outcome
**80 baseline → 3 architectural failures.** Phase 0 fs/env hardening complete.

## Recent fixes

**Network-dependent (8 specs):** swapped `https://example.com` for a local Node `http.Server` fixture (`e2e/fixtures/test-server.ts`). Routes: `/`, `/title-Example`, `/title-Other`, `/slow?ms=N`. Removes the DNS-hijack dependency and gives `82-browser-loading-animation` a deterministic 2s slow route.

**`30-terminal-core-behavior:222` flake:** replaced the brittle re-clear loop with seq-based reads. `clearBuffer` returns `clearedSeq`; we now read `getBufferSince(sessionId, clearedSeq)` to assert post-clear output. By construction `markerA` (pre-clear) cannot appear in chunks ≥ `clearedSeq`. 5/5 stability runs.

